1
00:00:00,083 --> 00:00:02,623
(Raj:)Great. Then she won't know I'm lying.

2
00:00:05,130 --> 00:00:09,680
(Raj:)Let's see, what else can I tell you
about me that would make you like me?

3
00:00:09,843 --> 00:00:11,303
(Howard:)Uh...

4
00:00:12,471 --> 00:00:13,601
(Raj:)Oh, I love music.

5
00:00:15,265 --> 00:00:16,725
(Raj:)Do you love music?

6
00:00:19,019 --> 00:00:21,059
You really wanna ask her that?

7
00:00:21,229 --> 00:00:23,649
Oh. You're right.
Heh, everyone loves music.

8
00:00:26,109 --> 00:00:28,399
(Howard:)She says,
"Do you play an instrument?"

9
00:00:28,778 --> 00:00:31,118
No, but when I was 6 years old...

10
00:00:31,281 --> 00:00:35,991
(Raj:)...I tried to start a boy band
called Frankie Goes to Bollywood.

11
00:00:39,247 --> 00:00:41,537
(Raj:)But I couldn't get any other boys
to join...

12
00:00:41,750 --> 00:00:45,420
(Raj:)...so my parents asked the servants
to be my backup dancers.

13
00:00:45,587 --> 00:00:48,587
(Raj:)Wait, when you sign servants,
don't sign it like I'm bragging.

14
00:00:48,757 --> 00:00:51,637
(Raj:)Sign it in a way that I sound humble,
with just a hint of:

15
00:00:51,801 --> 00:00:54,301
"That's right, I had servants."

16
00:00:56,848 --> 00:00:59,228
- Do you hear yourseIf?
- Yes, but she doesn't.

17
00:00:59,392 --> 00:01:05,022
(Raj:)So get signing, hand monkey.

